  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCMP Mali fase 2: consolidation and TOT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating: 
Vision Resharing Seminar: Held in 5 churches, this seminar strengthens the commitment of churches to collaborate with their communities through inspiring teachings.
Training of Co-Facilitators and Review Meetings: Local training sessions and bi-monthly review meetings improve co-facilitators&apos; capacity and ensure smooth team communication.
Advocacy Training: A one-day session to  enhance the advocacy skills of facilitators and church council members to address community needs.
Resharing the Vision with National Committees: Direct presentations align CCMP strategies with National Committees, fostering strategic collaboration.
Monitoring &amp; Evaluation: Regular tracking of participation, engagement, and feedback ensures effective implementation.

TOT training: This will include 2 from each of the partner churches of MFLM and the coordinator of CCMP. This is done in collaboration with Tearfund in Mali</narrative>
  </description>
